  "Chapter": "银河座　第4章",
  "Title": "银河的裂痕",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1030424001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座宣传负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "后援会的反响很好。/n还有新提出赞助意向的企业联系了我们。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1840",
      "BgmFileName": "7",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "演出主任",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "意料之中。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座宣传负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你看起来并不高兴啊。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座宣传负责人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "银河座展现了历史的分量与权威。/n又成功培养出Dai Star，明明已经保住了颜面。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "演出主任",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……可这个代价，或许太大了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1830",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.10000000149011612,
      "FadeValue2": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue3": 0.10000000149011612
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "前几天的记者会看了吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "结果早就知道了，我没兴趣。/n我们果然只是垫脚石。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你对千寿小姐当选不满吗？/n有实力的人待在应有的位置，不是理所当然的吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那与那国小姐和库尔特贝小姐呢～？/n我可没觉得千寿小姐是一枝独秀～。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊——够了，这种事怎样都好！/n比起这个，我更受不了今后还要一直维持这种气氛！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "比起千寿前辈，我更不能接受工作坊那件事。/n为什么只解雇部分参加者就算完了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就是说啊。遵循传统演戏的千寿小姐已经证明自己是对的。/n……也就是说，沃尔芙小姐才是错的吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "沃尔芙小姐的演技很厉害，这一点我也承认。/n所以她更应该重新考虑自己今后的去路。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1460",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.10000000149011612,
      "FadeValue2": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue3": 0.10000000149011612
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 79,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "渡濑云雀小姐。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "――啊！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呃……我、我没睡，没睡。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 303,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 12,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是在审议决定之前冥想吗？/n呵呵，还真有你的风格。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……能再确认一下吗？/n为什么你会对选出千寿历提出异议？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我倒没有强烈反对到能称作“异议”的程度――",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 2,
      "SeFileName": "641",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.10000000149011612,
      "FadeValue2": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue3": 0.10000000149011612
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "《桥弁庆》……是一场很符合银河座的厚重公演。/n其中尤其是千寿历。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "真不愧是千寿家的女儿啊。/n以她为中心，所有人的表演都被统合得非常漂亮。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（以千寿历为中心……这确实没错。/n　可真正牵引整个舞台的，还有另一个人。）",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她背负着家名和剧团的招牌，/n却仍塑造出了丝毫不逊于上代的弁庆形象。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她承受的压力，恐怕远非其他演员可比。/n即便如此，她还是回应了期待。很出色。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我基本同意。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240260",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 104,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "评审C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样啊。那关于这次人选，/n我还以为大家也会基本一致选择千寿历――",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我认为这是很合乎情理的人选。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 79,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你从刚才起说话就一直吞吞吐吐的，渡濑小姐。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "既然有不同意见，不妨明确说出来？/n这里应该没有什么需要你顾忌的吧？",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……优秀的舞台，不是靠一个人完成的。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240310",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "评审C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这不是理所当然的吗。/n我们的决定，本来就已经把这点纳入评价了吧？",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "确实，这次舞台上除她之外的星星也闪耀得十分出色。/n但最耀眼的仍然是千寿历。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……只是并不显眼而已，千寿历也有脆弱的一面。/n当那一点暴露出来时，她还能继续做Dai Star吗……",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "评审C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我明白你想说什么，/n可惜在选拔时，“对演员未来的影响”并不属于考虑范围。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "要是连那一点都考虑进去，那很多本该授予的称号也无法授予了。/n现在我们应该做的，只是赞扬她能在传统与压力之中绽放光芒，不是吗？",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是被授予的星之重量压垮，还是背负它继续飞跃。/n那同样是演员将会经历的重要未来，对吧？",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……您说得对。/n那么，就决定由千寿历成为新的Dai Star。",
      "WindowEffect": 2,
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240380",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 2,
      "SeFileName": "641",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.10000000149011612,
      "FadeValue2": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue3": 0.10000000149011612
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 43,
      "SpeakerName": "云雀",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "――在偏离王道路数的《麦克白》中，/n千寿历曾被饰演夫人的库尔特贝以角色完成度压过。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304240390",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 52201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "522"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030424044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030424,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 44,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
